# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) — or let `ossclip setup` write ~/.ossclip/.env
# for you. Resolution order, first hit wins per key, real env vars beat files:
#   $OSSCLIP_ENV_FILE  →  .env walking up from the cwd  →  ~/.ossclip/.env
#
# Only needed for --produce (the LLM graphics planner); cut + captions run
# fully local. A logged-in Claude Code CLI needs no key at all.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Binary/model overrides — normally unnecessary (config.json covers these):
# OSSCLIP_FFMPEG=/path/to/ffmpeg
# OSSCLIP_FFPROBE=/path/to/ffprobe
# OSSCLIP_WHISPER=/path/to/whisper-cli
# OSSCLIP_MODEL_DIR=~/.ossclip/models
# OSSCLIP_MODEL=small.en
